持双盲设计。本研究采用1:1:1平行随机分配，设SGC-R23低剂量组、SGC-R23高剂量组和安慰剂组三个治疗组。试验用药品仅用于本研究方案规定的治疗目的，不得用于任何其他用途。","rationale":"药物名称、技术类型（small_molecule）、给药途径（口服）、剂型（口服固体制剂）、暴露范围（systemic）、两个剂量水平（2.5mg/5mg）、给药频率（每日一次）、治疗时长（12周）、安慰剂外观与频次一致、1:1:1随机分配均来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。研究药物具体风险、非临床安全性数据及研究者手册引用内容未包含在允许来源中，需医学经理补充或确认是否在本章概述。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ca243367ca2a_cabc79172b6d3dce","section_number":"6.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:fcfbbbe566e7b13d39e093d2","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_a9bfa9b852a491f5ff97:r4:8c8b649c2614d867","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6eab08a4bddb3d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f24b1a78f9c3f8","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6b24da94f33534","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:36c8fd703b73e4"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261001051530_922f8e09","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_a9bfa9b852a491f5ff97:revision:4","quote":"SMOKE-r2-3（SGC-R23）为口服sGC激动剂；在GDMT基础上低剂量2.5mg、高剂量5mg每日一次，治疗12周","quote_sha256":"779d7cf329ec5137406280ef19b709de1646f4759c202e58ff21fb3302121bd7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_a9bfa9b852a491f5ff97:r4:8c8b649c2614d867","span_id":"es_001"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_a9bfa9b852a491f5ff97:revision:4","quote":"安慰剂：安慰剂口服片每日一次，外观与频次一致，治疗12周；1:1:1平行随机","quote_sha256":"94521fff9b92875cfd631e3e69f92ff64f4572d9c2b85c52a955412a6a7c3847","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_a9bfa9b852a491f5ff97:r4:8c8b649c2614d867","span_id":"es_002"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_a9bfa9b852a491f5ff97:revision:4","quote":"药物技术类型：small_molecule\n给药途径：口服\n剂型：口服固体制剂\n局部/系统暴露范围：systemic","quote_sha256":"93d70823288385813f38b773b8c6e7bba227a7ed893796844d8834e9f3bae884","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_a9bfa9b852a491f5ff97:r4:8c8b649c2614d867","span_id":"es_004"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_a9bfa9b852a491f5ff97:revision:4","quote":"试验组与对照组：SGC-R23低剂量组：SMOKE-r2-3口服sGC激动剂 2.5mg 每日一次；SGC-R23高剂量组：SMOKE-r2-3口服sGC激动剂 5mg 每日一次；安慰剂组：口服安慰剂 每日一次","quote_sha256":"1386c58a5e9076d8f9df3c21d85a7323c5988947ee2f4e464c248d9816a43cbe","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_a9bfa9b852a491f5ff97:r4:8c8b649c2614d867","span_id":"es_005"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_a9bfa9b852a491f5ff97:revision:4","quote":"研究时期：筛选期（最长14天）；双盲治疗期（12周）；安全性随访期（末次给药后14天）","quote_sha256":"07ee676da9169ff7bd8873a4eb194a9fea3f97590a5af13071efd2a7848b5a32","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_a9bfa9b852a491f5ff97:r4:8c8b649c2614d867","span_id":"es_006"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_001","es_002","es_004","es_005","es_006"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"gap_items":[],"heading":"研究药物信息","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"SMOKE-r2-3口服sGC激动剂（SGC-R23）为小分子可溶性鸟苷酸环化酶激动剂，以口服固体制剂形式给药，产生全身性暴露。SGC-R23片设两个规格：低剂量2.5mg和高剂量5mg，均以每日一次口服方式给药。安慰剂为口服片，不含活性成分，外观及给药频次与SGC-R23片一致，以维持双盲。SGC-R23活性药物与安慰剂均连续给药12周。本研究设SGC-R23低剂量组（2.5mg每日一次）、SGC-R23高剂量组（5mg每日一次）和安慰剂组（安慰剂片每日一次），三组按1:1:1比例随机分配。所有受试者在研究期间继续接受标准心衰治疗，试验用药品在标准心衰治疗基础上叠加使用。研究时期包括筛选期（最长14天）、双盲治疗期（12周）和安全性随访期（末次给药后14天）。","rationale":"药物名称、技术类型、给药途径、剂型、暴露范围、两个剂量规格、给药频率、治疗时长、安慰剂特征、1:1:1随机比例、标准心衰治疗背景及研究时期划分均来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。本章为研究药物信息描述，不涉及制备工艺或发放流程。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ca243367ca2a_ef5b1f9ab3826378","section_number":"6.1.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:fcfbbbe566e7b13d39e093d2","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_a9bfa9b852a491f5ff97:r4:8c8b649c2614d867","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6eab08a4bddb3d","company_cor